{
 "name": "Native VLAN mismatch",
 "about": "SW1's trunk sends VLAN 1 untagged; SW2's trunk treats untagged frames as VLAN 99. Untagged traffic leaks between VLAN 1 on SW1 and VLAN 99 on SW2, and VLAN 1 is split in two. Tagged VLAN 10 is unaffected.",
 "nodes": [
